---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Tienda" active="tienda">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-4 sm:py-6 w-full space-y-4">
    <header class="glass-panel px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl">
      <span class="text-[10px] font-display font-bold text-galaxy-400 uppercase tracking-widest bg-galaxy-600/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-galaxy-400/30">Economía</span>
      <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-extrabold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-shadow-glow mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-store text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Tienda</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs mt-0.5">Gana XP y tokens jugando, valorando y cumpliendo retos semanales; gasta los tokens en objetos cosméticos. Nada de lo que se vende cambia quién gana un partido.</p>
    </header>

    <div id="ti-error" hidden role="alert" class="rounded-xl border border-rose-400/40 bg-rose-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-200 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i><span id="ti-error-txt" class="flex-1 min-w-0"></span>
      <button type="button" id="ti-reintentar" class="btn btn-ghost !min-h-8 !px-3 !text-[11px]">Reintentar</button>
    </div>

    <section id="ti-cartera" class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-4" aria-live="polite"></section>

    <div id="ti-tabs" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" role="tablist" aria-label="Tienda">
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="tienda" aria-selected="true" class="adv-chip !min-h-9">Tienda</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="inventario" aria-selected="false" class="adv-chip !min-h-9">Mi inventario</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="ganar" aria-selected="false" class="adv-chip !min-h-9">Cómo ganar</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="tokens" aria-selected="false" class="adv-chip !min-h-9">Comprar tokens</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="historial" aria-selected="false" class="adv-chip !min-h-9">Historial</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-tab="admin" aria-selected="false" class="adv-chip !min-h-9" hidden id="ti-tab-admin">Administrar</button>
    </div>
    <div id="ti-contenido" class="space-y-3" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
<script>
  import '../js/pages/tienda.js';
</script>
